      "message": "test(app): expect the part-off at Z12 in the example catalog\n\nReplace the stale assert in the cone-thread catalog test. It expected\nG01 X0. Z13.5, an old value. The program that the PR posts ends the\npart-off at G01 X0. Z12. F0.02. That is the value in cone-thread.nc:680\nand groove-part-off.nc:101. Add a note on the kerf and the issue.\n\nRefs #3472\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
